nostr-settings (0.4.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build Settings separately from the headless bundle; do not configure
    nostr-share or change the headless libnostr ABI.
  * Depend on the shared Grotto panels runtime and SDK.
  * Add local --version/--help coverage and ship the private JSON backend.
  * Keep the legacy Debian bundle version ordering above 0.4.0-1; the
    independently versioned, unreleased Settings application remains 0.1.0.

 -- GNostr Project <gnostr@example.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0800
